    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_complex_travel_resolution_diplomatic_language",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-01",
        "slug": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-diplomatic-language",
        "title": "Diplomatic challenge and disagreement",
        "rule_summary": "Challenge an idea rather than a person, acknowledge intent, and soften direct negatives while keeping the substantive point clear.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "به‌جای شخص، ایده را به چالش می‌کشیم؛ نیت را می‌پذیریم و بدون مبهم کردن اصل پیام، منفی مستقیم را نرم‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I see the logic, though I'm not convinced the assumption holds in this case.",
            "fa": "منطقش را می‌بینم، هرچند قانع نشده‌ام این فرض در این مورد برقرار باشد."
          },
          {
            "en": "That may be true in principle, but the practical constraints are different.",
            "fa": "در اصل شاید درست باشد، اما محدودیت‌های عملی متفاوت‌اند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_complex_travel_resolution_advanced_passive",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-02",
        "slug": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-advanced-passive",
        "title": "Advanced passive choices",
        "rule_summary": "Use passive forms, including get-passives and passive infinitives, when agency is unknown, sensitive, obvious, or less important than the process.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "وقتی انجام‌دهنده نامعلوم، حساس، بدیهی یا کم‌اهمیت‌تر از فرایند است از شکل‌های پیشرفته مجهول، از جمله get-passive و passive infinitive استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Several applications appear to have been rejected automatically.",
            "fa": "به نظر می‌رسد چند درخواست به‌صورت خودکار رد شده‌اند."
          },
          {
            "en": "The issue needs to be addressed before launch.",
            "fa": "این مسئله باید قبل از عرضه رسیدگی شود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_complex_travel_resolution_complex_prepositions",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-03",
        "slug": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-complex-prepositions",
        "title": "Complex prepositional phrases",
        "rule_summary": "Use in light of, with regard to, in the absence of, by virtue of, and at the expense of to express precise logical relations.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای بیان روابط منطقی دقیق از in light of، with regard to، in the absence of، by virtue of و at the expense of استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "In light of the new evidence, the recommendation should be revised.",
            "fa": "با توجه به شواهد جدید، توصیه باید بازبینی شود."
          },
          {
            "en": "Efficiency should not come at the expense of accessibility.",
            "fa": "کارایی نباید به قیمت دسترسی‌پذیری تمام شود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_complex_travel_resolution_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-complex-travel-resolution-01",
        "title": "Complex Travel Resolution: part 1",
        "setting": "professional workshop",
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "transport",
        "characters": [
          "Nora",
          "Samir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "How would you respond without making the disagreement personal?",
            "translation_fa": "چطور جواب می‌دادی بدون اینکه مخالفت شخصی بشه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "The initial delay became a complex disruption because the replacement route caused us to miss the final connection.",
            "translation_fa": "تأخیر اولیه تبدیل به اختلال پیچیده شد چون مسیر جایگزین باعث شد اتصال آخر رو از دست بدیم."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "What could you concede while still holding your position?",
            "translation_fa": "چی رو می‌تونی بپذیری و در عین حال موضعت رو حفظ کنی؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "I am happy to be rerouted, provided the new itinerary gets me to the destination today rather than tomorrow morning.",
            "translation_fa": "با تغییر مسیر مشکلی ندارم، به شرطی که برنامه جدید امروز منو برسونه نه فردا صبح."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
